# GitHub Personal Access Token — powers the footer contribution graph.
#
# Create one at https://github.com/settings/tokens
#   • Classic token: NO scopes are required for public contribution data.
#   • Fine-grained token: read-only, no extra permissions needed for public data.
#
# Local dev:  copy this file to `.env.local` and paste your token below.
# Production: add GITHUB_TOKEN in Vercel → Project → Settings → Environment Variables.
#
# If this is unset, the footer gracefully degrades to the email link only.
GITHUB_TOKEN=
